@startuml
actor Player
boundary "Inventory UI" as UI
participant Map01Inventory
participant "Craft queue" as Queue
participant Checkpoint
Player -> UI : Select recipe and quantity
UI -> Map01Inventory : TryCraft(recipeId, times)
Map01Inventory -> Map01Inventory : Check materials capacity and location
Map01Inventory -> Queue : Consume inputs once and enqueue
Queue -> Map01Inventory : Grant output once after craft duration
Map01Inventory -> Checkpoint : Persist settled bag and queue state
Map01Inventory --> UI : Return actionable result
@enduml
